::  modules/brushstroke/glow/fold-studio-triptych.glow -- 3-Panel Studio!
/-  compiler-shapes
/!  32768
|%
++  gate-triptych-bounds
  |=  [sign=@ud quorum=@ud width=@ud]                   ::  1..15, <=405, >=360
  ^-  @ud                                               ::  verified quorum
  ~|  'brushstroke-triptych-bounds-refused'             ::  Glasswall frame
  ?>  &(gte(sign 1) lte(sign 15) lte(quorum 405) gte(width 360))
  quorum
--
